  "body": "`camcraft-ui --lib` test `tool_editor_snapshot` panics at `core/src/ptr/mod.rs:847` on plain `origin/main` (seen 2026-11-08 ~05:20Z by the PR #240 reviewer, run from CWD `crates/ui`, debug). The other 259 ui lib tests pass.\n\nIt is a panic, not a snapshot pixel mismatch (#66 was the mismatch case), so it is likely a debug-mode safety precondition (`ptr` precondition check) hit inside the tool editor's draw path or a dependency it calls.\n\nRepro: `cd crates/ui && cargo test -p camcraft-ui --lib tool_editor_snapshot -- --exact`\n\nNot caused by PR #240 (fails identically without it). Blocks a green ui gate; the v0.14.0 release gate will report it.\n",
